           "left, Control Center for quick settings, notifications and the calendar."),
         draw_menubar, [(_("Show on Screen"), "spot:bar"), (_("Open Control Center"), ("luxos-cc-toggle",))]),
        (_("The Dock"),
         _("Your favourite apps are at the bottom of the screen. Click an icon to open the app – a dot "
           "below it means the app is running. Drag apps from Launchpad to the Dock, drag them out to "
           "remove them."),
         draw_dock, [(_("Show on Screen"), "spot:dock")]),
        (_("Launchpad and Search"),
         _("Super + A opens Launchpad with all your apps. Super + Space searches apps, files and windows. "
           "Type a question instead and LuxAI will answer it – Ctrl + Enter always asks LuxAI."),
         draw_launchpad, [(_("Open Launchpad"), ("luxos-launchpad",)), (_("Open Search"), ("luxos-search",))]),
